# Purpose: Allowlist build context for the mx-inv image - only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Version: v2 (2026-10-07) - v2: allow migrations/ (schema runner, imported at start). v1 (2026-09-24)
# Scope: PRODUCTION - read by docker build (CI).
# Architecture: mx-inv. The working tree holds an SSH private key (pi-ssh-key), the live
#   DB and ~140 DB backups, purchase data and research files: ignore EVERYTHING, then
#   allow back the few paths the image needs. Never loosen this to a denylist.
*
!requirements-server.txt
!data.py
!db_schema.py
!telemetry_sync.py
!backend/
!migrations/
!docker/backup.py
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
